# Licensed fonts — never commit. The docs set V2's faces (Switzer and Boska under the Fontshare
# FFL, Neue Montreal Mono from Pangram Pangram), and both licences forbid redistribution through a
# repository. globals.css falls back to system-ui when the files are absent. Only web font
# formats: the library's MSDF sources and the OG image's Inter are .ttf and stay tracked.
*.woff
*.woff2
